// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
// CONJUNCTIONS WORKSHEET — a self-contained dashboard plugin (upper primary:
// Year 3+; ACARA Y3–6 — joining clauses with and/but/or/so/because/when/if/
// before).
//
// The dashboard loads this plugin by calling `ConjunctionWorksheet(dashboard)`
// with its configurations + layouts (see plugins/index.ts). Within this
// function the plugin describes:
//   - its SIDEBAR LABEL ("Conjunctions", glyph "+") and which grades offer it;
//   - what happens when its label is CLICKED: its worksheet — generated by
//     the framework's standard worksheet recipe (dashboard.createWorksheet).
//
// Fully self-contained: deleting this file and its line in plugins/index.ts
// removes the Conjunctions worksheet without affecting the framework or any
// other plugin.
//
// T4C REDESIGN (quality over quantity): the page shrank from 16 rows to 6
// roomy prose rows (these are full-sentence tasks — they need space).
// SEMANTIC FIX: the old generator cross-multiplied ANY left clause with ANY
// right clause of a conjunction, which produced broken logic — "Our team
// scored a goal because it was raining". The banks are CURATED
// [left, right] pairs per conjunction family, each pair verified to carry
// that conjunction's real logic (cause for because, consequence for so,
// contrast for but, addition for and). T5E review: the first rework cut the
// SEMANTIC space below the old (invalid) one (346 vs 1223 measured), so the
// banks grew 16 → 24 pairs per family and the when/if bank 20 → 28 lines —
// the space now clears the 100-page ask with VALID questions only.
// New families: an explicit JOIN-AS-EDIT task (deterministic answer) and an
// open-ended COMPOSE whose key gives one example and accepts any sensible
// sentence.
// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

import type { Caps, DashboardFramework, DashboardPlugin, GradeConfig, RawProblem, Rng, WorksheetSpec } from '../../framework';
import { sampleUnique } from '../../framework';

